# Styling Guidelines & Tailwind CSS Rules

## Styling Stack
- **CSS Framework**: Tailwind CSS 4.x
- **Component Library**: Flowbite React
- **Utility**: `clsx` for conditional classes
- **Theme**: "Oatmeal" theme (yellow/amber color scheme)

## Tailwind CSS Usage

### Utility Classes
- Use Tailwind utility classes for styling
- Prefer utility classes over custom CSS
- Use responsive prefixes: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`, `2xl:`
- Mobile-first approach

### Class Organization
```typescript
// ✅ Good: Logical grouping
className="flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg"

// ✅ Better: Using clsx for conditionals
import clsx from 'clsx'

className={clsx(
  'flex items-center justify-center p-4 rounded-lg',
  'bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-gray-800',
  isLoading && 'opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed',
  variant === 'primary' && 'bg-yellow-600 hover:bg-yellow-700'
)}
```

## Dark Mode Support

### Dark Mode Classes
- Always support dark mode using `dark:` variants
- Test both light and dark modes
- Use theme-aware colors

### Dark Mode Pattern
```typescript
// ✅ Dark mode support
<div className="bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-gray-800 text-yellow-900 dark:text-yellow-100">
  Content
</div>

// ✅ Dark mode borders
<div className="border-2 border-yellow-200 dark:border-gray-700">
  Content
</div>
```

## Flowbite Integration

### Using Flowbite Components
- Wrap/extend Flowbite components when possible
- Pass through Flowbite props
- Add custom styling via `className` prop

### Flowbite Component Example
```typescript
import { Button as FlowbiteButton, Spinner } from 'flowbite-react'

export const Button: React.FC<ButtonProps> = ({ 
  children, 
  className,
  ...props 
}) => (
  <FlowbiteButton 
    {...props}
    className={clsx(
      'custom-classes',
      className
    )}
  >
    {children}
  </FlowbiteButton>
)
```

## Oatmeal Theme Colors

### Primary Colors (Yellow/Amber)
- Light mode: `bg-yellow-50`, `bg-yellow-100`, `bg-yellow-200`, `bg-yellow-600`, `bg-yellow-700`
- Dark mode: `dark:bg-gray-800`, `dark:bg-gray-700`, `dark:text-yellow-300`
- Text: `text-yellow-800`, `text-yellow-900`, `dark:text-yellow-100`, `dark:text-yellow-300`

### Theme Pattern
```typescript
// ✅ Oatmeal theme colors
<Card className="bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-gray-800 border-2 border-yellow-200 dark:border-gray-700">
  <h2 className="text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300">Title</h2>
  <p className="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Content</p>
</Card>
```

## Responsive Design

### Mobile-First Approach
```typescript
// ✅ Mobile-first: base styles for mobile, then larger breakpoints
<div className="
  flex flex-col
  md:flex-row
  lg:gap-4
  xl:p-8
">
  Content
</div>
```

### Breakpoints
- `sm:` - 640px and up
- `md:` - 768px and up
- `lg:` - 1024px and up
- `xl:` - 1280px and up
- `2xl:` - 1536px and up

## Conditional Styling

### Using clsx
```typescript
import clsx from 'clsx'

// ✅ Conditional classes
className={clsx(
  'base-classes',
  isActive && 'active-classes',
  variant === 'primary' && 'primary-classes',
  variant === 'secondary' && 'secondary-classes',
  className // Allow override
)}
```

## Component Styling Patterns

### Card Component
```typescript
<Card className="
  w-full max-w-md p-8
  bg-yellow-50 dark:bg-gray-800
  shadow-lg
  border-2 border-yellow-200 dark:border-gray-700
  rounded-2xl
  transition-colors
">
  Content
</Card>
```

### Button Component
```typescript
<Button
  className="
    bg-yellow-600 hover:bg-yellow-700
    text-white
    dark:bg-yellow-500 dark:hover:bg-yellow-600
    dark:text-gray-900
  "
>
  Button Text
</Button>
```

### Input Component
```typescript
<Input
  className="
    border-yellow-300 dark:border-gray-600
    focus:ring-yellow-500 focus:border-yellow-500
    dark:focus:ring-yellow-400 dark:focus:border-yellow-400
  "
/>
```

## Accessibility

### Focus States
- Always include focus states for interactive elements
- Use Flowbite's accessible components
- Test keyboard navigation

### Focus Pattern
```typescript
// ✅ Focus states
<button className="
  focus:outline-none
  focus:ring-2
  focus:ring-yellow-500
  focus:ring-offset-2
">
  Button
</button>
```

## Common Styling Mistakes

- ❌ Not supporting dark mode
- ❌ Using custom CSS when Tailwind utilities exist
- ❌ Not using mobile-first approach
- ❌ Not testing responsive design
- ❌ Missing focus states
- ❌ Not using clsx for conditional classes
- ❌ Hardcoding colors instead of using theme colors

## Global Styles

### Global CSS
- Global styles in `src/styles/globals.css`
- Use Tailwind directives: `@tailwind base`, `@tailwind components`, `@tailwind utilities`
- Custom CSS only when necessary

